## Style Studio group toggle badges with group color

Context: The small top-left collapse/expand (+) badges on Studio entities and
group super-nodes used a white circle with a dark plus. The plus also looked
slightly off-center. Use each ontology group's color as the badge background
and center the white + both horizontally and vertically.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-map.js
   Set studio-group-toggle circle fill to the member/group color; pin + text
   at (0,0) with middle/central baselines.
2. src/front/static/ontology/css/ontology-map.css
   Drop white fill override; white + glyph; hover brightens stroke without
   replacing the group color.
3. tests/units/front/test_studio_views_groups_contract.py
   Assert group-color fill and centering attributes for the toggle badge.

Modified files:
- src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-map.js
- src/front/static/ontology/css/ontology-map.css
- tests/units/front/test_studio_views_groups_contract.py

